{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1779280522, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/usr/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "claude-base — 60-second tour"}
[0.395168, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[0.898182, "o", "# Step 1 — install the foundation\r\n"]
[1.701104, "o", "+ curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/christopherlouet/claude-base/main/install.sh\r\n"]
[1.701323, "o", "+ bash\r\n"]
[2.041952, "o", "[INFO] Cloning https://github.com/christopherlouet/claude-base.git into /home/demo/.local/share/claude-base\r\n"]
[2.044984, "o", "Cloning into '/home/demo/.local/share/claude-base'...\r\n"]
[4.388651, "o", "[INFO] Linked /home/demo/.local/bin/claude-base → /home/demo/.local/share/claude-base/bin/claude-base\r\n"]
[4.390605, "o", "\r\nclaude-base installed.\r\n\r\nNext steps:\r\n  1. Make sure /home/demo/.local/bin is on your PATH. Most modern Linux distros and\r\n     macOS put it there automatically. If 'which claude-base' shows\r\n     nothing after opening a new shell, add this to your shell rc file:\r\n\r\n         export PATH=\"/home/demo/.local/bin:$PATH\"\r\n\r\n  2. Verify the install:\r\n\r\n         claude-base version\r\n         claude-base help\r\n\r\n  3. Initialize a project:\r\n\r\n         claude-base init --preset fastapi ./my-api\r\n         claude-base init --preset nextjs   ./my-web-app\r\n         claude-base init --simple          ./my-other-project\r\n\r\n  4. Update later:\r\n\r\n         claude-base update ./my-project\r\n         # or to update the foundation itself:\r\n         curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/christopherlouet/claude-base/main/install.sh | bash -s -- --update\r\n\r\n"]
[5.594167, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[5.59439, "o", "# Step 2 — drop the foundation into a new Next.js project\r\n"]
[6.395881, "o", "+ claude-base init --preset nextjs --yes /home/demo/work/my-app\r\n"]
[6.469337, "o", "[INFO] Preset: Next.js full-stack (maintainer-vouched)\r\n"]
[6.54167, "o", "\r\nClaude-Base - Simple Install\r\n\r\n"]
[6.562782, "o", "[INFO] Installing claude-base in: /home/demo/work/my-app\r\n\r\n"]
[6.563046, "o", "[INFO] Installing Claude files...\r\n"]
[6.786295, "o", "[OK] Commands, skills, agents, rules, styles, templates, docs and hook scripts copied\r\n"]
[6.845033, "o", "[OK] CLAUDE.md copied\r\n[OK] Design direction added: editorial\r\n"]
[6.848818, "o", "[OK] CLAUDE.local.md.example copied\r\n"]
[6.849034, "o", "[INFO] Installing GitHub Actions...\r\n"]
[6.856404, "o", "[OK] GitHub Actions installed\r\n[INFO] Installing pre-commit hooks...\r\n"]
[6.876043, "o", "[OK] Pre-commit hooks installed\r\n"]
[6.879622, "o", "[OK] .gitignore created\r\n"]
[6.898231, "o", "\r\n📚 Recommended vendor skills for this stack (opt-in):\r\n\r\n"]
[6.909558, "o", "  Always pair with this preset:\r\n"]
[6.93631, "o", "    [--] • vercel-labs/agent-skills\r\n      Canonical react-best-practices and Next.js patterns from Vercel Engineering\r\n      → https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills\r\n"]
[6.937879, "o", "      $ git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills\r\n"]
[6.972582, "o", "    [?] • frontend-design@claude-plugins-official\r\n      Anthropic's official UI design plugin (avoid generic Inter+purple aesthetic)\r\n      → https://claude.com/plugins/frontend-design\r\n"]
[6.97417, "o", "      $ claude plugin install frontend-design@claude-plugins-official\r\n"]
[7.007585, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.033471, "o", "  Add if your project uses these tools:\r\n"]
[7.050953, "o", "    [--] • supabase/agent-skills — if using Supabase\r\n      Auth, DB, Edge Functions, Realtime, Storage patterns + Postgres best practices\r\n      → https://github.com/supabase/agent-skills\r\n"]
[7.05192, "o", "      $ git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/supabase/agent-skills\r\n"]
[7.076831, "o", "    [--] • prisma/skills — if using Prisma\r\n      Prisma ORM patterns, especially v7 (ESM-only, driver adapters)\r\n      → https://github.com/prisma/skills\r\n"]
[7.077822, "o", "      $ git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/prisma/skills\r\n"]
[7.101541, "o", "    [--] • shadcn-ui/ui (skills/shadcn) — if using shadcn/ui\r\n      shadcn/ui CLI v4, Radix + Base UI primitives, theming patterns\r\n      → https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/tree/main/skills/shadcn\r\n"]
[7.102452, "o", "      $ git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/tree/main/skills/shadcn\r\n"]
[7.131619, "o", "    [--] • apollographql/skills — if using Apollo GraphQL\r\n      Apollo Client, Apollo Server 5, Federation 2\r\n      → https://github.com/apollographql/skills\r\n"]
[7.13343, "o", "      $ git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/apollographql/skills\r\n\r\n  See docs/recipes/recommended-vendor-skills.md for install commands.\r\n\r\n"]
[7.153932, "o", "[OK] git repository initialized\r\n\r\n"]
[7.156988, "o", "============================================================\r\n"]
[7.157377, "o", "[OK] Installation complete!\r\n"]
[7.160134, "o", "============================================================\r\n"]
[7.160373, "o", "\r\n[INFO] Installed files:\r\n"]
[7.168315, "o", "  - .claude/commands/      (131 commands)\r\n"]
[7.176164, "o", "  - .claude/skills/        (54 skills)\r\n"]
[7.183454, "o", "  - .claude/agents/        (63 agents)\r\n"]
[7.194063, "o", "  - .claude/rules/         (16 rules for stack 'react', 30 available in the foundation)\r\n  - .claude/output-styles/ (output styles)\r\n  - .claude/templates/     (spec templates, Proxmox, etc.)\r\n"]
[7.218926, "o", "  - .claude/settings.json  (23 hooks)\r\n  - .claude/docs/reference/ (CLAUDE.md @import files)\r\n  - .claude/docs/guides/    (guides per domain)\r\n"]
[7.224641, "o", "  - scripts/hooks/         (8 scripts referenced by settings.json)\r\n  - CLAUDE.md\r\n  - CLAUDE.local.md.example\r\n\r\n[INFO] Next steps:\r\n  1. Customize CLAUDE.md for your project\r\n  2. Copy CLAUDE.local.md.example to CLAUDE.local.md\r\n  3. Launch Claude Code: cd /home/demo/work/my-app && claude\r\n"]
[7.224734, "o", "\r\n[INFO] Available commands:\r\n"]
[7.224994, "o", "  /work:work-explore, /work:work-plan, /work:work-commit, etc.\r\n\r\n"]
[8.429904, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
